WEBVTT

00:02:58.163 --> 00:03:00.038
Most economists estimate,

00:03:00.038 --> 00:03:02.913
although an excess on one side
or the other may be dangerous,

00:03:02.913 --> 00:03:06.663
low and constant inflation
is necessary for economic growth.

00:03:06.663 --> 00:03:09.746
The FED uses vast quantities
of economic data

00:03:09.746 --> 00:03:12.746
to determine how much
of currency must be in circulation,

00:03:12.746 --> 00:03:16.246
including previous inflation rates,
international trends,

00:03:16.246 --> 00:03:17.496
and the unemployment rate.

00:03:17.496 --> 00:03:18.913
As in a fairy tale,

00:03:18.913 --> 00:03:21.163
they need to find
the perfect balance

00:03:21.163 --> 00:03:24.246
in order to boost growth
and maintain full employment,

00:03:24.246 --> 00:03:27.246
without leaving inflation
reach disruptive levels.

00:03:27.246 --> 00:03:29.538
The FED not only determines

00:03:29.538 --> 00:03:31.663
how much this paper is worth
in your wallet